flowchart TD
      A[Customer types policy number] --> B["GET /api/claims/policy/{policyNumber}<br/>(OURS — real Mongo lookup)"]
      B --> C["POST /api/claims/questions (repeated)<br/>(AVINASH — dynamic 2-step questionnaire)"]
      C --> D[Upload required documents]
      D --> E["POST /api/claims/submit (multipart)"]

      E --> F{{Per uploaded file<br/>independent, isolated failures}}
      F --> G["FileValidationService<br/>(RUPALI — MIME/size check, non-AI)"]
      G --> H["OcrService → PdfTextOcrService<br/>(RUPALI — real PDFBox text extraction)"]
      H --> I["DocumentRelevanceAgent<br/>(RUPALI — embed + cosine similarity;<br/>Ollama call only in borderline confidence band)"]
      I -->|valid + relevant| J["DocumentValidationAgent<br/>(RUPALI — checks doc against retrieved clause)"]
      I -->|not relevant / invalid| K[Flagged, excluded from validation]

      J --> L["PolicyRagAgent<br/>(RUPALI — once per claim, not per file)"]
      L --> M{{"policy_clauses OR policy_clause_vectors?<br/>⚠ OPEN DECISION — not yet chosen"}}

      J --> N{{All files processed}}
      K --> N
      N --> O["Multi-agent investigation — PARALLEL<br/>(AVINASH — thread pool)"]

      O --> P1[RequirementAgent<br/>required docs present?]
      O --> P2[PolicyCoverageAgent<br/>incident covered by clause?]
      O --> P3[InvestigationAgent<br/>OCR fields vs typed answers?]

      P1 --> Q["FinalJudgeAgent<br/>(AVINASH — weighted confidence,<br/>deterministic Java calc + LLM reasoning)"]
      P2 --> Q
      P3 --> Q

      Q --> R{Verdict}
      R -->|APPROVED| S1[Mongo write: claims + claim_investigations]
      R -->|REJECTED| S1
      R -->|HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED| S1

      S1 --> T["Router → /investigating/:claimId<br/>(AVINASH — animated per-agent reveal)"]
      T --> U["Router → /decision/:claimId<br/>(AVINASH — verdict + confidence + findings)"]

      V[Add Policy screen — always reachable from nav] --> W["POST /api/policies<br/>(OURS — real Mongo save)"]
      W --> X[(policies collection)]

      style M fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#e0a800
      style A fill:#e7f3ff
      style U fill:#d4edda
      style V fill:#e7f3ff
